              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakubanika inhliziyo eyodwa, ngibeke umoya omusha phakathi kwenu; futhi ngiyokhipha inhliziyo yetshe enyameni yabo ngibanike inhliziyo yenyama.",
